---
const parts = [
  { label: 'Tether interface', question: 'Where does the load go?', text: 'The cable and the payload need a continuous load path between them. This collar and frame illustrate that connection; the joint design and its strength are not solved here.' },
  { label: 'Guidance & power', question: 'How do two moving objects meet?', text: 'Relative navigation, communications and electrical power would support the encounter. The lab constructs an ideal matched approach; this illustrative equipment is not a simulated guidance system.' },
  { label: 'Capture interface', question: 'What actually makes the handoff?', text: 'A payload needs an attachment and a controlled release. These guide jaws illustrate the idea, not qualified capture hardware. Impact, cable waves and latch reliability remain engineering problems.' },
];
---
<section class="terminal-story" id="capture-terminal" aria-labelledby="terminal-title" data-renderer="static" data-exploded="false" data-part="0">
  <div class="terminal-editorial">
    <p class="section-index">CLOSER / THE HANDOFF</p>
    <h2 id="terminal-title">An orbit is only<br />half the story.</h2>
    <p class="terminal-intro">At the end of the tether, a moving machine must meet another moving machine. Take this illustrative terminal apart to explore the questions behind the handoff.</p>
    <div class="terminal-part-list" role="group" aria-label="Capture terminal components">
      {parts.map((part, index) => <div class="terminal-part">
        <button type="button" data-part-button={index} aria-pressed={index === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'} aria-controls={`terminal-part-${index}`}><span>0{index + 1}</span>{part.label}<i aria-hidden="true">↗</i></button>
        <div id={`terminal-part-${index}`} class="terminal-part-copy" data-part-copy={index}><h3>{part.question}</h3><p>{part.text}</p></div>
      </div>)}
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/lab/method/#events">See what the lab actually models <span>↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="terminal-instrument">
    <div class="terminal-mode" role="group" aria-label="Capture terminal view">
      <button type="button" data-terminal-mode="assembled" aria-pressed="true">Assembled</button>
      <button type="button" data-terminal-mode="exploded" aria-pressed="false">Exploded view <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal-viewport">
      <div class="terminal-canvas-host" aria-label="Interactive illustrative capture terminal"></div>
      <svg class="terminal-fallback" viewBox="0 0 520 560" role="img" aria-label="Capture-terminal schematic: tether interface above guidance and power bay above capture interface">
        <defs><linearGradient id="terminal-metal" x1="0" x2="1"><stop stop-color="#bac6c6"/><stop offset=".4" stop-color="#3e5055"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#869898"/></linearGradient></defs>
        <g fill="none" stroke="#667d81" stroke-width="1"><path d="M75 110H435M75 280H435M75 450H435" stroke-dasharray="2 9"/></g>
        <g class="terminal-diagram-top"><path d="M254 56V138M265 56V138" stroke="#c4d2cf" stroke-width="4"/><path d="M180 165L219 139H302L340 165V192L298 213H222L180 192Z" fill="url(#terminal-metal)" stroke="#bfcec9"/><path d="M240 128H280V173H240Z" fill="#d89456"/><ellipse cx="260" cy="128" rx="20" ry="7" fill="#182c30"/></g>
        <g class="terminal-diagram-core"><path d="M180 228L220 205H300L340 228V323L300 345H220L180 323Z" fill="#102c30" stroke="#9caeac" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M180 228L220 250H300L340 228M220 250V345M300 250V345" fill="none" stroke="#bdc4ba" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M231 268H289V305H231Z" fill="#8c613d"/><path d="M239 278H280M239 285H280M239 292H263" stroke="#dcbda0"/><circle cx="319" cy="264" r="12" fill="#74a7b0"/></g>
        <g class="terminal-diagram-base"><ellipse cx="260" cy="385" rx="95" ry="30" fill="#30494c" stroke="#b6c5c3" stroke-width="5"/><ellipse cx="260" cy="385" rx="58" ry="16" fill="#080b0d" stroke="#deaa76" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M178 387L201 426L222 411M342 387L319 426L298 411M256 411V440H269V411" fill="none" stroke="#d49358" stroke-width="12"/></g>
      </svg>
      <div class="terminal-view-label" aria-live="off"><span class="terminal-live-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span><span data-terminal-caption>01 / TETHER INTERFACE</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="terminal-camera" role="group" aria-label="Capture terminal camera">
      <span data-terminal-render-status>Interactive illustration</span>
      <button type="button" data-terminal-action="rotate" aria-pressed="false">Rotate model</button>
      <button type="button" data-terminal-action="reset">Reset view</button>
    </div>
    <p class="terminal-disclaimer"><strong>Concept assembly / not to scale.</strong> Illustrative geometry, not a manufactured design or the lab’s structural model. Exploded spacing is a display aid.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script>
  import { initTerminalStory } from '../scripts/terminal-story';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('.terminal-story').forEach(initTerminalStory);
</script>
